flowchart LR
    subgraph TEV [TEV 暂态地电压]
        direction TB
        A1[开关柜金属外壳] --> A2[TEV传感器<br>磁吸式安装]
        A2 --> A3[检测原理:<br>趋肤效应感应电压]
    end
    
    subgraph Ultrasonic [超声波检测]
        direction TB
        B1[柜体缝隙 / 观察窗] --> B2[超声波探头<br>接触/非接触]
        B2 --> B3[检测原理:<br>放电产生的声波]
    end
    
    style TEV fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style Ultrasonic fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style A1 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style A2 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style A3 fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style B1 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style B2 fill:#fff,stroke:#000
    style B3 fill:#fff,stroke:#000,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
